    {
      "id": "p0043-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby joins a community for fans of Homestuck, a popular multimedia comic series. For fun, he remixes Homes tuck music and shares it with other fans. The series creators, impressed by Toby's work, bring him on as an official music producer in 2010. Despite being entirely self-taught, Toby quickly becomes a revered musician in the Homestuck community. As a hobby, Toby also begins to design a video game that will eventually be known as Undertale.",
        "raw": "Toby joins a community for fans of Homestuck, a popular multimedia comic\nseries. For fun, he remixes Homes tuck music and shares it with other fans. The\nseries creators, impressed by Toby's work, bring him on as an official music\nproducer in 2010. Despite being entirely self-taught, Toby quickly becomes a\nrevered musician in the Homestuck community. As a hobby, Toby also begins to\ndesign a video game that will eventually be known as Undertale.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
